{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth02_title", "source_sha256": "c9a0c42606c12c2de9a68c03cf83ed7067009063edeb6693a2e49c9edc4c970b", "ja": "琴葉とおでかけ2", "zh": "和琴叶外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f555e51ce0eddcda7910c5e573b159b783e0bd6f3f343533048b011fc2700b6a", "ja": "琴葉とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和琴叶一起外出的那一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6501e79ded9063e45f0843e49bca0ad1d904cd2dd21c6e2cc675ae9633b8f36b", "ja": "（仕事の合間に空き時間ができたので、\n琴葉と沖縄料理店で食事をした）", "zh": "（工作间隙有了一点空闲时间，就和琴叶去冲绳料理店吃了顿饭。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth02_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "4d830ed3aa693eb9652bce2c206ae4c28cf50303d80b4ea109e7841539239abd", "ja": "おいしかったですね、{$P$}。\nゴーヤチャンプルーも、すごく食べやすくて。", "zh": "真好吃呢，{$P$}。苦瓜炒蛋也特别容易入口。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "758301cacf27fe84420439a9e63b0c526199b98bee6830eb243027a5389744f0", "ja": "ゴーヤ独特の苦みが全然なくておいしかったよ。\nさすが、本場は違うな。", "zh": "完全没有苦瓜特有的苦味，很好吃。\n果然，正宗的就是不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth02_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "0b914ef7740b0a1b89c1d891e13f03ab5ac10de2e96f923a9e2f2c1ab645332b", "ja": "そうですね。苦味がちっともないのに、\nゴーヤの歯ごたえはしっかり残っていて……。", "zh": "是啊。明明一点苦味都没有，\n却还保留着苦瓜特有的爽脆口感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth02_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "b13ac669b21141439fcabbfbea476c36b71085e241038c37e58f893945e428ce", "ja": "こんなふうにおいしく作れるなら、\n私も挑戦してみようかな……。", "zh": "要是能做得这么好吃，我也想试试看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1e681d57b35d871962f755048161e23983818e75c164cbcba47fab27a67c0002", "ja": "琴葉は、よく料理をするのか？", "zh": "琴叶，你经常做饭吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth02_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "d33a024f73719cb7e522384e378c9515ba0e7ab6f1ec4386333322e88cb4eb8e", "ja": "母の手伝いをするくらいです。\nなので、まだ勉強中なんですけど。", "zh": "也就帮妈妈做做饭而已。\n所以现在还在学习中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth02_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "19963a2bba3b1084fa79c8fa42e7ae8e054274b970f2ca0d2308228f974a0be8", "ja": "お土産も、もちろん買いますけど……\n作ってあげたら、家族がよろこぶかもって……。", "zh": "土特产当然也会买，不过……\n要是亲手做点什么带回去，家人可能会很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6d1fd42c926388d0e0048e0f21eb0346593af010bcfd7faca05ba9c33177547e", "ja": "うん、いいんじゃないか？\n琴葉の手料理、何よりの手土産だと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，挺不错的啊？\n我觉得琴叶亲手做的料理，就是最棒的伴手礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_017kth02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_017kth02_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "ec919e17e3afd157d186a9563b8e0a04f509c8bdc0da7c27b312f0394ca75dec", "ja": "はい、がんばってみます！　上手にできたら、\n{$P$}も食べてくださいね♪", "zh": "好的，我会努力试试的！要是做得好吃，也请{$P$}尝尝哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
